2026-07-27T08:23:42.3587341Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3588146Z i /tmp/Rtmps88muG/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3588710Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3589360Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3590199Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3591283Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3592818Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:23:42.3593823Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
